<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Lion Land year net up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Lion Land year net up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 113.13   vs	  95.14</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     19.1    vs	  20.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		 2,350.99   vs     1,405.60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   125.63   vs	 115.74</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  4.47   vs  less   3.40</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    less 72.52   vs   add   1.25</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 7.0    vs	   7.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Lion Land Bhd is a property and trading group.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
